INSERT INTO "Question__c" VALUES('Question__c-2093','true','','','','','','','','false','','','','','3.0','false','true','','false','','','','','','','','','','','false','','','','','Course Interests ND Audit (GCAS)','Name','false','','','','','','','0124P0000003S9QQAU','','','','','<p><br></p><p>Non-Degree: The option may be of interest to students with a desire to pursue graduate study but not necessarily in obtaining a degree. Enrolling in one or more courses at the non-degree status will provide contact with faculty members and an opportunity to evaluate whether the programs offerings match a student’s needs, interests, and abilities. Up to six credits taken as a non-degree student may be applied for credit towards the degree.</p><p><br></p><p>Audit: 2- or 3-credit courses may be audited. Auditors pay reduced tuition rates based on a percentage formula. If a student audits a class, they cannot receive graduate credit. Students who audit Kodály or Orff Schulwerk are still eligible to receive the certificate if they audit the courses.</p><p>Visit <a href="https://www.stthomas.edu/businessoffice" target="_blank">https://www.stthomas.edu/businessoffice</a> to learn more.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style="font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">PLEASE NOTE: You cannot be registered for courses until your finished application has been submitted.</strong></p>','','','','Requirement_Item__c-665');
