INSERT INTO "Question__c" VALUES('Question__c-3473','false','','','','Started App;Submitted App','','','','false','','','','','5.0','false','true','Started App','false','','','','','','','','','','','false','','','','','Ethical Decision-Making Static (UGBSN)','Name','false','','','','','','','0124P0000003S9QQAU','','Started App','','','<p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">(3) The School of Nursing&#39;s mission calls for graduates to partner with others in providing ethical care focused on the whole person (mind, body, and spirit) and whole community. Describe a situation where you worked collaboratively to demonstrate ethical decision-making to address inequity and promote social justice.</span></p>','','','','Requirement_Item__c-270');
