e candidate is employed by the district as a paraprofessional, during the second year of the program (field experience &amp; student teaching), the district agrees to gradually relieve the candidate of his/her/their paraprofessional duties. This will allow the candidate to take the role of a full-time Special Education teacher during the student teaching experience.</span></p>','','','','Requirement_Item__c-790');
INSERT INTO "Question__c" VALUES('Question__c-3827','true','','','','','','','','false','','','','','22.0','false','true','','false','','','','','','','','','','','false','','','','','Consent Instr 2 Static (SOEd)','Name','false','','','','','','','0124P0000003S9QQAU','','Started App;Submitted App;Complete App','','','<p><span style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">The district and building leaders agree to employ the paraprofessional, Tier I or Tier II teacher during the Work and Learn Program. If at any point during the Work and Learn program the candidate is no longer employed by the district, it is the candidate&#39;s responsibility to notify the University of St. Thomas of changes in employment status.</span></p>','','','','Requirement_Item__c-790');
