INSERT INTO "Question__c" VALUES('Question__c-3973','true','','','','Started App;Submitted App','','','','false','','','','','4.0','false','true','Started App','false','','','','','','','','','','','false','Are you a first generation college student?','','','','First Generation static (UGTRCAM)','Name','false','','','','','','','0124P0000003S9QQAU','','Started App','','','<p>The term ‘‘first-generation college student’’ means either: (A) an individual both of whose parents did not complete a bachelor&#39;s degree; or (B) in the case of any individual who regularly resided with and received support from only one parent, an individual whose only such parent did not complete a bachelor&#39;s degree.</p>','','','','Requirement_Item__c-883');
